  "summary": "Postinstall beacon exfiltrates host identifiers to webhook.site",
  "details": "On npm install, scripts.postinstall executes index.js which collects os.hostname(), os.userInfo().username, process.cwd(), and a timestamp and POSTs the JSON to a hardcoded webhook.site URL (https://webhook.site/e6b10849-38dc-4280-a8e3-72ab39cfaf65). scripts.preinstall additionally writes a marker file to the hardcoded absolute path /home/OFFA/flag. Package metadata (version 999.0.1, generic 'Fake Name' author, minimal description) is consistent with a dependency-confusion payload targeting an internal @offa scope.",
